Badge images for video overlays. Drop PNG/JPG/WEBP files here named:
  confession.{png,jpg,webp}   — Confession
  chat.{png,jpg,webp}         — Chat with Harold
  wisdom.{png,jpg,webp}       — Harold Wisdom
  advice.{png,jpg,webp}       — Harold Advice
  question.{png,jpg,webp}     — Question for Harold

PNG with transparency is recommended so the badge composites cleanly.
Studio's Step 5 picks one of these by name and overlays it on the video.
